	(text "Expansion pads (top side, board edge): wire-solder pads, no connector fitted.\nFull peripherals named by function; loose pins named by pin (role set in firmware).\nPB7, PC2: 0 mA negative injection (DS8626 Table 47), keep wires short.\nPC14, PC15: power switch, 3 mA sink only, no source (DS8626 Table 7, note 3)."
